      "name": "Custom HTML/Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"margin:18px 0; padding:18px; border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); background:#fff;\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:20px;\">Eye Mini Bundles from Elite Sim Golf</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    If you’re ready to build a dedicated home simulator that looks clean, plays consistent, and doesn’t require weeks of piecing parts together—this is it.\n    Our turn-key bundles are built around Uneekor’s <strong>Eye Mini</strong>. Choose your bay size (10ft or 12ft) and your visual tier\n    (Standard, Premium 1080P, or Premium 4K)—we handle the rest. <b>Each Complete Simulator Bundle includes Free Setup Support.</b>  \n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n    <a href=\"#shopify-section-template--19390515511490__main\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:11px 16px; border-radius:999px; background:#086ed3; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700;\">\n      Shop Bundles\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\":[\n    {\n      \"@type\":\"Question\",\n      \"name\":\"What comes in an Eye Mini bundle from Elite Sim Golf?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\":{\n        \"@type\":\"Answer\",\n        \"text\":\"Eye Mini bundles include the Uneekor Eye Mini launch monitor, an Elite Sim Golf enclosure (10ft or 12ft), a BenQ short-throw projector (varies by package), ProTee 5x5 hitting mat, 6x12 landing mat, projector mount, and a projector install kit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\":\"Question\",\n      \"name\":\"Should I choose the 10ft or 12ft package?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\":{\n        \"@type\":\"Answer\",\n        \"text\":\"Choose 10ft if your room is tighter and you want a premium enclosure footprint. Choose 12ft if you want more comfort, easier shared play, and a more immersive full-bay feel.\"\n  