    "custom_liquid_GFnayA": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom HTML/Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"margin:18px 0; padding:18px; border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); background:#fff;\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:20px; color:#111827;\">Eye Mini Bundles from Elite Sim Golf</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    If you’re ready to build a dedicated home simulator that looks clean, plays consistent, and doesn’t require weeks of piecing parts together—this is it.\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"height:10px;\"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Our <strong>Eye Mini bundles</strong> are designed around Uneekor’s ground-based <strong>Eye Mini</strong> launch monitor and packaged into complete,\n    room-ready builds. You choose your bay size (10ft or 12ft) and your visual tier (Standard, Premium 1080P, or Premium 4K). We handle the rest.\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"height:10px;\"></div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Every bundle in this collection is a matched system—launch monitor, enclosure, projector, and finished floor—so everything works together the way it’s supposed to.\n  </p>\n\n  <hr style=\"border:0; height:1px; background:#eef2f7; margin:14px 0;\">\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; color:#111827;\">What’s Included in Every Package</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Each Eye Mini bundle includes the key components you need for a clean, turn-key sim bay:\n  </p>\n\n  <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; color:#374151; line-height:1.65;\">\n    <li><strong>Uneekor Eye Mini Launch Monitor</strong> (ground-based launch monitor for indoor training + range sessions)</li>\n    <li><strong>Elite Sim Golf Enclosure</strong> (choose 10ft or 12ft bay size)</li>\n    <li><strong>BenQ Short-Throw Projector</strong> (varies by package)</li>\n    <li><strong>Elite ProTee 5x5 Hitting Mat</strong> with replaceable hitting strip</li>\n    <li><strong>Elite Sim Golf 6x12 Landing Mat</strong> for a finished floor from tee to screen</li>\n    <li><strong>Projector Mount</strong></li>\n    <li><strong>Projector Install Kit</strong> (long-run cabling so your install stays clean)</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    <strong>Result:</strong> a simulator bay that looks intentional—not pieced together.\n  </p>\n\n  <hr style=\"border:0; height:1px; background:#eef2f7; margin:14px 0;\">\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; color:#111827;\">Choose Your Bay Size</h3>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:10px 0; padding:12px; border:1px solid #eef2f7; border-radius:12px; background:#fafafa;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:800; color:#111827; margin:0 0 6px;\">10FT Packages — Birdie 10 Enclosure</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n      Best for tighter garages and smaller rooms where you still want a premium enclosure look and a tall, golf-friendly screen window.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin:10px 0; padding:12px; border:1px solid #eef2f7; border-radius:12px; background:#fafafa;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:800; color:#111827; margin:0 0 6px;\">12FT Packages — Eagle 12 Enclosure</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n      Best for golfers who want the “full studio” feel—more comfortable stance options, better shared play, and a more immersive visual experience.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr style=\"border:0; height:1px; background:#eef2f7; margin:14px 0;\">\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; color:#111827;\">Choose Your Visual Tier</h3>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:10px; margin-top:10px;\">\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #eef2f7; background:#fafafa; border-radius:12px; padding:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; background:#fff; font-weight:900; font-size:12px; color:#111827;\">\n        Standard (Best Value)\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.55;\">\n        The most budget-smart way to get playing fast with a proper enclosure + short throw projection.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #eef2f7; background:#fafafa; border-radius:12px; padding:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #cfe5ff; background:#eff6ff; color:#0b4ea8; font-weight:900; font-size:12px;\">\n        Premium 1080P (Brighter Upgrade)\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.55;\">\n        The jump you feel immediately in real rooms—better brightness and a more premium-looking image, especially if you have any ambient light.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"border:1px solid #eef2f7; background:#fafafa; border-radius:12px; padding:12px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-block; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #cfe5ff; background:#eff6ff; color:#0b4ea8; font-weight:900; font-size:12px;\">\n        Premium 4K (Maximum Detail)\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.55;\">\n        The flagship visual experience—cleaner UI, sharper text, and maximum course detail for that “high-end bay” look.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <style>\n    @media (max-width: 860px){\n      .esg-eye-mini-tier-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}\n    }\n  </style>\n\n  <hr style=\"border:0; height:1px; background:#eef2f7; margin:14px 0;\">\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; color:#111827;\">Which One Should You Pick?</h3>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; color:#374151; line-height:1.65;\">\n    <li>Want the best value in a smaller space? <strong>10FT Standard</strong></li>\n    <li>Want a brighter image without going full 4K? <strong>Premium 1080P</strong></li>\n    <li>Want the sharpest, most premium visual experience? <strong>Premium 4K</strong></li>\n    <li>Want the most comfortable bay for shared play and longer sessions? <strong>12FT Eagle packages</strong></li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    If you’re unsure, we’ll help you choose based on your room.\n  </p>\n\n  <hr style=\"border:0; height:1px; background:#eef2f7; margin:14px 0;\">\n\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; color:#111827;\">Need Help Confirming Fit?</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">Send us your:</p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:0; padding-left:18px; color:#374151; line-height:1.65;\">\n    <li>Room width</li>\n    <li>Ceiling height</li>\n    <li>Room depth</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; color:#4b5563; line-height:1.6;\">\n    …and we’ll recommend the best bay size and cleanest projector placement for your space.\n  </p>\n</div>",
