        "custom_liquid": "<!-- =========================================================\nElite Sim Golf — Eye Mini vs Spica 3 vs Garmin R50 (PDP STYLE / INLINE)\nNo max-width / no container sizing (theme controls page width)\n========================================================= -->\n\n<!-- ===== HERO / SUMMARY CARD ===== -->\n<div style=\"margin:18px 0; padding:18px; border:1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); background:#fff;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b7280; font-weight:800; margin:0 0 6px;\">\n    Launch Monitor Comparison\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px; font-size:20px; color:#1f2937;\">Eye Mini vs Spica 3 vs Garmin R50</h2>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:0; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Three popular “no-overhead-install” launch monitors—each with a different strength. Use this guide to pick the right engine\n    for your simulator bay (and your practice style).\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px; display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <a href=\"#esg-lm-compare-table\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:11px 16px; border-radius:999px; background:#086ed3; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:800;\">\n      Jump to Comparison\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"#esg-lm-quick-picks\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:11px 16px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #dbeafe; background:#eff6ff; color:#086ed3; text-decoration:none; font-weight:800;\">\n      Help Me Choose\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:12px; line-height:1.6;\">\n    Need help confirming fit? Call <strong style=\"color:#1f2937;\">866-4-SIM-GOLF</strong> or text us 24/7.\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ===== QUICK PICKS (3 CARDS) ===== -->\n<div id=\"esg-lm-quick-picks\" style=\"\n  margin:16px 0;\n  padding:16px 16px;\n  border:1px solid #e6e6e6;\n  border-radius:14px;\n  box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n  back